[[Kournan Pendant]]s are [[item]]s dropped by [[Kournan military|soldiers from Kourna]].

==Acquisition==
*[[Nightfall]]
**[[Kournan military]]


''Drop and salvage research is ongoing, and can be found [[Talk:Kournan Pendant#Drop research|here]].''

===Farming===
Head south from [[Kodonur Crossroads]] into [[Dejarin Estate]] and cross over both bridges. The grassed section, and particularly in and around the fortification at the south end of the grass, contains many Kournan groups.

