==Notes== 
*The collector [[Sinbi]] trades 10 Kournan Pendants for scrolls that sell for 400 {{gold}} to a merchant and at least 400 {{gold}} to a [[rare scroll trader]]. This provides a return that is at least 33% more than just selling the trophies by themselves.
* The [[Beautiful Pendant]], [[Token of Janthir]], and [[Wayfarer's Mark]] use the same [[inventory]] icon as this item.

